OL,3,GNEWSAThree men stabbed in bar street
OL,4,Aattack, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been stabbed outside a
OL,7,Fbar in a city centre street attack.
OL,9,FMerseyside Police said the men were
OL,10,Ffound injured just after 06:30 BST in
OL,11,FTithebarn Street, Liverpool. They had
OL,12,Fbeen attacked outside the G-Bar on
OL,13,FEberle Street.
OL,15,FTwo of the men are in a stable
OL,16,Fcondition while the third sustained
OL,17,Fminor injuries, the force said. Police
OL,18,Fhave appealed for information.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
